### teste de cadastro de cliente - rota privada
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{LoginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "nome":"joao",
    "email":"joao@gmail",
    "senha":"852",
    "cpf":"123456789"
}

